Life in Abu Dhabi.

3184
03:17:29,620 --> 03:17:34,340
Transitioning into a Muslim household came with its challenges, but nothing I couldn't handle.

3185
03:17:34,420 --> 03:17:37,080
Ahmed's family welcomed me with love and grace.

3186
03:17:37,160 --> 03:17:39,911
I restarted my law career in Abu Dhabi.

3187
03:17:39,991 --> 03:17:44,280
It wasn't easy, but I persisted and built something solid.

3188
03:17:44,360 --> 03:17:47,108
We lived with his parents for seven and a half years.

3189
03:17:47,188 --> 03:17:51,924
Life was comfortable, a good home, a supportive family, and household health.

3190
03:17:52,004 --> 03:17:52,880
Things were stable.

3191
03:17:52,960 --> 03:17:56,218
The move to Toronto.

3192
03:17:56,298 --> 03:17:59,872
In 2021, we moved to Toronto on express entry PR.

3193
03:17:59,952 --> 03:18:02,650
I had to rebuild my career yet again.

3194
03:18:02,730 --> 03:18:04,360
I studied law for exams.

3195
03:18:04,440 --> 03:18:09,720
I studied for law exams while working full-time and managing the household. With God's grace,

3196
03:18:09,800 --> 03:18:16,040
I passed and now work as in-house counsel at a finance company. Life with Amir until recently.

3197
03:18:16,120 --> 03:18:22,360
Amir and I have always had a good life. We're a child free by choice and have traveled the

3198
03:18:22,440 --> 03:18:23,534
world together.

3199
03:18:23,614 --> 03:18:29,640
From seeing the Aurora Borealis in Iceland to whale watching in New Zealand,

3200
03:18:29,720 --> 03:18:32,330
we've had a share of disagreements, of course, but also.

3201
03:18:32,410 --> 03:18:36,240
countless joyful moments. Physically, we were compatible and communicative.

3202
03:18:36,320 --> 03:18:38,926
Here in Toronto, it's just the two of us.

3203
03:18:40,214 --> 03:18:45,570
We do have a good social circle, but he and I have always been each other's anchor.

3204
03:18:45,650 --> 03:18:49,322
Amir has always worked in banking and has done well professionally.

3205
03:18:49,402 --> 03:18:51,367
He's kind, easygoing, honest, and loving.

3206
03:18:51,447 --> 03:18:55,330
We rarely fought, respected each other's boundaries, and made decisions together.

3207
03:18:55,410 --> 03:18:58,940
The move to Toronto was hard, but we stood by each other as a team.

3208
03:18:59,020 --> 03:19:04,060
He has been faithful and so have I. I've known this man since 2012.

3209
03:19:04,140 --> 03:19:09,260
And then, everything was going well until our tenth wedding anniversary earlier this year.

3210
03:19:09,340 --> 03:19:13,380
I had planned a small celebration and discussed it with Amir, but he dismissed the idea.

3211
03:19:13,460 --> 03:19:19,540
I asked why. He gave a very vague, dismissive answer. I said, okay, then you plan something.

3212
03:19:19,620 --> 03:19:25,526
On that, on the day itself, I finished work, bought flowers and cake, came home,

3213
03:19:25,606 --> 03:19:26,640
showered and waited.

3214
03:19:26,720 --> 03:19:31,640
He came home tired, empty-handed and said, let's just order in.

3215
03:19:31,720 --> 03:19:38,640
I said, sure. Our favorite Thai food we ate. Ordered our favorite Thai food we ate and then he went to bed.

3216
03:19:38,720 --> 03:19:41,908
I was hurt, but I still hoped we'd do something over the weekend.

3217
03:19:41,988 --> 03:19:43,423
But the weekend came and went.

3218
03:19:43,503 --> 03:19:45,081
No gesture, no flowers, no plans.

3219
03:19:45,161 --> 03:19:48,540
So I asked him gently, don't I even deserve a single flower from you?

3220
03:19:48,720 --> 03:19:52,720
He looked at me and said, I have no feelings for you. Oh shit.

3221
03:19:55,827 --> 03:19:56,528
I was stunned.

3222
03:19:56,608 --> 03:19:57,980
I asked him what he meant.

3223
03:19:58,060 --> 03:20:01,558
Was I now no different than a stranger on the street?

3224
03:20:01,638 --> 03:20:04,987
He asked for a time, a full year to figure out his feelings.

3225
03:20:05,067 --> 03:20:05,489
I agreed.

3226
03:20:05,569 --> 03:20:09,727
I asked if I had hurt him on his family or his family in any way.

3227
03:20:09,807 --> 03:20:14,185
He said no, that I had been amazing and that his family loves me very dearly.

3228
03:20:14,265 --> 03:20:15,214
Where we are now.

3229
03:20:15,294 --> 03:20:16,497
Six months have passed.

3230
03:20:16,577 --> 03:20:21,050
When I asked him recently where he stands, his response was, I am still where I am.

3231
03:20:21,130 --> 03:20:23,050
Still where I was six months ago.

3232
03:20:23,130 --> 03:20:29,050
Junaid, he's asked me to move on, move on, but he doesn't want me to live separately.

3233
03:20:29,130 --> 03:20:31,050
And for some reason I'm listening to him.

3234
03:20:31,130 --> 03:20:33,050
Maybe it's hope. Maybe it's fair.

3235
03:20:33,130 --> 03:20:39,050
We've been sleeping in separate rooms. We barely talk or only transactional, only transactional exchanges.

3236
03:20:39,130 --> 03:20:43,050
I urge him to speak to someone, a therapist, a friend, anyone. He refuses.

3237
03:20:43,130 --> 03:20:48,130
His family senses something is off, but he won't open up to them either.

3238
03:20:48,820 --> 03:20:50,201
I haven't told my parents yet.

3239
03:20:50,281 --> 03:20:51,937
I want to speak to them in person.

3240
03:20:52,017 --> 03:20:53,606
I've tried to reconnect.

3241
03:20:53,686 --> 03:20:55,018
I've tried physical intimacy.

3242
03:20:55,098 --> 03:20:58,100
I reached out and he just hugged me and said, don't do this.

3243
03:20:58,180 --> 03:21:03,340
It's very heartbreaking for a woman when a woman,

3244
03:21:03,420 --> 03:21:07,820
so like women likes to be women like to be approached,

3245
03:21:07,900 --> 03:21:10,780
especially when it comes to intimacy.

3246
03:21:10,860 --> 03:21:15,460
Even if you have a paid service, even she won't.

3247
03:21:17,020 --> 03:21:17,857
approach you.

3248
03:21:17,937 --> 03:21:21,537
Like, you understand what I'm saying?

3249
03:21:21,617 --> 03:21:27,121
But like, and it takes a lot for a woman to make the first move.

3250
03:21:27,201 --> 03:21:32,487
And when it's when she's rejected, that hurts her really, really bad.

3251
03:21:32,567 --> 03:21:38,689
Because then it's a signal that you're not wanted or you're not desired at all.

3252
03:21:38,769 --> 03:21:42,693
Because you know, men switch on very quickly.

3253
03:21:42,773 --> 03:21:44,910
So if that is not even worth it,

3254
03:21:44,990 --> 03:21:46,002
even working.

3255
03:21:46,082 --> 03:21:49,276
But I know it's also of course mental.

3256
03:21:49,356 --> 03:21:52,713
A man has to be there mentally as well.

3257
03:21:52,793 --> 03:21:59,541
So if even that is not working, like that's like the final card, you know.

3258
03:21:59,621 --> 03:22:03,823
So if that doesn't work, then that's very hurtful.

3259
03:22:03,903 --> 03:22:08,587
So I understand what you must have gone through.

3260
03:22:08,667 --> 03:22:12,570
So why I'm writing to you, I just wanted to

3261
03:22:12,650 --> 03:22:17,390
wanted to understand from a man's perspective. Is it because we chose not to have children?

3262
03:22:17,470 --> 03:22:22,070
Is it the move to Toronto? Is it because I'm hyper-independent and don't need him

3263
03:22:22,150 --> 03:22:27,630
