3265
03:22:30,015 --> 03:22:32,549
What conversation, what moment, what shift?

3266
03:22:32,629 --> 03:22:35,539
It feels like he doesn't even want to fight for us.

3267
03:22:35,619 --> 03:22:36,795
He's just checked out.

3268
03:22:36,875 --> 03:22:39,340
Do you think you can offer any insight?

3269
03:22:39,420 --> 03:22:44,105
any insight because I'm tired so tired of looking for answers in silence.

3270
03:22:44,185 --> 03:22:52,839
I know it's a long email and I'm sorry you don't have to answer this right away or even on the show you could just write me back if you want to.

3271
03:22:52,919 --> 03:23:03,862
Well writing back is more difficult because you can't talk about it in detail but first of all thank you so much for your email I'm really sorry to hear what I what I just read.

3272
03:23:03,942 --> 03:23:06,400
So you heard this email the lady was from Delhi.

3273
03:23:06,480 --> 03:23:12,400
She moved to Abu Dhabi, eloped and spent seven years there.

3274
03:23:12,480 --> 03:23:14,400
After that, she moved to Toronto.

3275
03:23:14,480 --> 03:23:20,400
Life was very comfortable in Abu Dhabi, but of course, she had to come back to India.

3276
03:23:20,480 --> 03:23:26,400
So it's better to secure your passport and that's the route a lot of people take.

3277
03:23:26,480 --> 03:23:29,400
And rightfully so, there's no blame.

3278
03:23:29,480 --> 03:23:32,400
You can't live in the UAE all your life.

3279
03:23:32,480 --> 03:23:33,850
So for that, they moved to Toronto.

3280
03:23:33,930 --> 03:23:38,646
and they're by themselves or on the tenth anniversary,

3281
03:23:38,726 --> 03:23:45,650
there was a lot of disconnect and after that things are just downhill.

3282
03:23:45,730 --> 03:23:48,750
So first of all, do not label yourself crazy.

3283
03:23:48,830 --> 03:23:54,900
You're just heartbroken and when a ten year relationship, such a good relationship,

3284
03:23:54,980 --> 03:24:01,360
like you explained that you've traveled far and wide and you had a good life, good family.

3285
03:24:01,440 --> 03:24:05,681
good connection, suddenly when that falls down, it hurts a lot.

3286
03:24:05,761 --> 03:24:11,160
It feels like a death, but like death of a person who's like moving around you.

3287
03:24:11,240 --> 03:24:15,058
He's sitting in front of you, going in front of you.

3288
03:24:15,138 --> 03:24:17,807
And the silence hits the loudest because, like you said,

3289
03:24:17,887 --> 03:24:19,889
