3290
03:24:19,969 --> 03:24:21,160
Then it will be the same.

3291
03:24:21,240 --> 03:24:27,518
Shoes are there, food is hot, ordered, come while taking this and that's it.

3292
03:24:27,598 --> 03:24:28,670
And I've seen those.

3293
03:24:28,750 --> 03:24:31,670
I've seen those happening here and there as well.

3294
03:24:31,750 --> 03:24:34,670
Feels very disconnected.

3295
03:24:34,750 --> 03:24:40,670
Now in this, of course, you're on a hunt of finding out what's wrong.

3296
03:24:40,750 --> 03:24:43,670
He's not seeking therapy. He's just not giving any clarity.

3297
