He just doesn't want to leave you. He just wants you around.

3298
03:24:48,540 --> 03:24:52,374
So he doesn't want to be alone.

3299
03:24:52,454 --> 03:24:55,750
He wants to be left alone.

3300
03:24:56,860 --> 03:24:57,780
That's the thing.

3301
03:24:57,860 --> 03:25:01,780
Now what is this happening and what is happening?

3302
03:25:01,860 --> 03:25:03,780
There could be multiple layers to it.

3303
03:25:03,860 --> 03:25:07,780
One is maybe the migration.

3304
03:25:07,860 --> 03:25:09,780
Canada can be very depressing.

3305
03:25:09,860 --> 03:25:16,780
And then alone without any support, without any help, for two people, it can be very emotionally taxing.

3306
03:25:16,860 --> 03:25:22,860
So it's probably not around you. It's maybe he lacks identity.

3307
03:25:23,780 --> 03:25:29,380
purpose, emotional energy, maybe the life has become very repetitive and monotonous.

3308
03:25:31,620 --> 03:25:35,620
You said you're 37, so I'm assuming he must be touching 40s.

3309
03:25:35,700 --> 03:25:37,620
You feel like you're 40.

3310
03:25:37,700 --> 03:25:44,180
When everything gets sorted, see, why is there so much depression in Japan and Sweden?

3311
03:25:44,900 --> 03:25:51,780
Because there's nothing to look forward to. A man is driven by a challenge. Repetitive monotony kills a person.

3312
03:25:51,940 --> 03:25:52,248
Now,

3313
03:25:52,328 --> 03:26:01,660
you are saying that is it because you are hyper-independent and you don't rely on him.

3314
03:26:01,740 --> 03:26:04,330
So, being independent is not a crime.

3315
03:26:04,410 --> 03:26:06,360
It's a disconnection problem.

3316
03:26:06,440 --> 03:26:10,110
It's not an independence problem.

3317
03:26:10,190 --> 03:26:11,660
It's a disconnection.

3318
03:26:11,740 --> 03:26:16,740
Now, why is it disconnecting? What is happening? That needs to be looked into.

3319
03:26:17,700 --> 03:26:22,255
Often we've seen that women who are strong, women who are independent,

3320
03:26:22,335 --> 03:26:27,780
they internalize a guilt that maybe it's because I don't need anything from him.

3321
03:26:27,860 --> 03:26:34,020
Maybe he feels that his protector and provider check-out is not happening.

3322
03:26:34,100 --> 03:26:35,060
I can hear my son.

3323
