3326
03:26:41,009 --> 03:26:43,250
So he's just here to say hello.

3327
03:26:43,330 --> 03:26:45,850
He's tippy-toeing as if I can't see him.

3328
03:26:45,930 --> 03:26:46,610
Hi.

3329
03:26:50,170 --> 03:26:51,650
Hello. How was school?

3330
03:26:52,130 --> 03:26:53,490
Oh, I need to go up.

