You need to say Salam.

3332
03:26:54,810 --> 03:26:55,730
Salam.

3333
03:26:55,810 --> 03:26:58,050
Oh, no, no, no, no. Say Assalamu Alaikum.

3334
03:26:58,130 --> 03:26:58,890
Wa Alaikum.

3335
