Yes.

3339
03:27:04,330 --> 03:27:06,320
Yes. No?

3340
03:27:08,100 --> 03:27:10,900
Go, have lunch. I'm gonna come, yeah?

3341
03:27:12,100 --> 03:27:13,100
Close the door!

3342
03:27:14,100 --> 03:27:17,020
Close the d- Sorry. Sorry.

3343
03:27:17,100 --> 03:27:22,020
Uhh, so like I was saying, that strong women often internalize guilt.

3344
03:27:22,100 --> 03:27:25,842
Uhh, that maybe I took away the purpose from him.

3345
03:27:25,922 --> 03:27:27,815
And maybe that's what it is.

3346
03:27:27,895 --> 03:27:34,610
But, uhh, it's not like he probably felt redundant or that he didn't need me.

3347
03:27:34,690 --> 03:27:40,610
I don't think it's like an emotional connection doesn't rely on dependence.

3348
03:27:40,690 --> 03:27:46,690
It relies on vulnerability and honesty. Communication is based on this.

3349
03:27:46,860 --> 03:27:50,071
So dependency that just because you're dependent on me,

3350
03:27:50,151 --> 03:27:54,610
