But when you have sufficient help around, and this is something that of course I've noticed a lot even in my own home.

3356
03:28:18,390 --> 03:28:27,350
Like every working housewife or a working woman.

3357
03:28:28,120 --> 03:28:34,718
who has to look after the kids as well, especially overseas, especially in the West,

3358
03:28:34,798 --> 03:28:42,403
they really do miss being back home because there's a lot of help around and parents are there,

3359
