I am shoveling snow.

3366
03:29:03,192 --> 03:29:04,562
I had a great life in Doha.

3367
03:29:04,642 --> 03:29:05,910
The hell I am doing here.

3368
03:29:05,990 --> 03:29:08,315
So, could be a lot of things.

3369
