Mentally check out is very common among men.

3370
03:29:12,124 --> 03:29:18,462
They rely on the fact that, oh, like, you know, I can't be weak.

3371
03:29:18,542 --> 03:29:20,990
They don't communicate.

3372
03:29:21,780 --> 03:29:23,700
a lot more, they're not emotional.

3373
