Or, in front of the parents, there's a weird veil.

3374
03:29:31,780 --> 03:29:38,700
You can't, you barely see guys being emotional or vulnerable around their parents, right?

3375
03:29:38,780 --> 03:29:41,700
Or communicating. So that's out.

3376
03:29:41,780 --> 03:29:43,700
In friends, they fear judgment. They don't do it.

3377
03:29:43,780 --> 03:29:45,780
Therapy, they don't seek.

3378
03:29:47,050 --> 03:29:54,970
So I think the move to Toronto has triggered some sort of like cultural recalibration.

3379
03:29:55,050 --> 03:29:59,970
It's a big shift. If you're accustomed to a certain lifestyle, it's a big shift.

3380
03:30:00,050 --> 03:30:02,929
And I think that plus monotony.

3381
03:30:03,009 --> 03:30:09,970
Now as far as, sir, like you know you were like a family unit in Abu Dhabi.

3382
03:30:10,050 --> 03:30:12,050
So when you have help around, when you have.

3383
03:30:14,200 --> 03:30:18,651
like you know a comfort bubble, you don't see so many things.

3384
