But like when that strips away and you're in a new, highly demanding world,

3385
03:30:24,725 --> 03:30:27,950
then you see more connection or lack thereof.

3386
03:30:28,030 --> 03:30:39,019
You feel that oh now you can like basically acknowledge each other or like have a different viewpoint.

3387
03:30:39,099 --> 03:30:41,910
Whereas of course when you have folks

3388
03:30:41,990 --> 03:30:47,030
folks around when you have a different life all together, especially in a city where you have lived your whole life.

3389
