In his case, Abu Dhabi, there are lots of distractions.

3390
03:30:52,390 --> 03:30:55,830
There's family at home, friends outside, you have a proper life, etc.

3391
03:30:55,910 --> 03:31:02,710
Whereas, you know, a move to the West or a highly demanding country like Canada, strips a lot of those things away.

3392
03:31:02,790 --> 03:31:08,150
