Right?

3408
03:31:54,950 --> 03:32:01,870
I'm speaking, I'm not selling a phone or a card reader. The only product I have is speech.

3409
03:32:01,950 --> 03:32:04,200
And I become speechless because when it comes to.

3410
03:32:04,280 --> 03:32:11,120
when it comes to being emotional or perhaps vulnerable.

3411
03:32:11,200 --> 03:32:12,120
I don't understand.

